        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.40.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 40:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze nunamuye amaso mbona umuntu afise mu minwe umugozi wo kugera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndamubaza, nt’ Uroye hehe? Arambarira, ati Ngiye kugera Yerusalemu, ngo ndābe amakika n’amadūga vyaho uko bireha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umumarayika twavugana yīgira imbere, umumarayika wundi aza kumusanganira: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EST.9.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Est 9:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.49.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 49:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aramubarira, at’ Irukanga, ubgire uwo musore, ut’ I Yerusalemu hazosubira gusagaza abantu nk’ibisagara bitazitiriwe, kukw abantu n’amasho bizohaba ari vyinshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.125.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 125:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.4.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 4:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw ari jewe nzohabera uruzitiro rw’umuriro ruhakikije, ni k’Uhoraho agize, kandi nzohabera ubgiza ndi hagati mu mugoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.48.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 48:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.5.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 5:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yemwe! Yemwe! Ni muhunge muve mu gihugu c’i burārūko, ni k’Uhoraho agize; kuko nk’ukw ibirēre bine vy’ijuru vyītangūranye, ari ko nabasābagije, ni k’Uhoraho agize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yewe Siyoni ubana n’umukobga w’i Babuloni, cika uhunge! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 32:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.12.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 12:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ ukw ari k’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo agize, ni we yantumye kumuhesha icubahiro mu mahanga yabanyaze; at’ Ūbakorako aba akoze ku mbone y’ijisho ryiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.11.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 11:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.19.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.33.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 33:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.39.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "39:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehe nzoyabangurirak’ ukuboko kwanje, kand’ azohinduka inyagano z’abāyashumbiye: ni ho muzomenya yuk’ Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo ari we yantumye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.26.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lew 26:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.37.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 37:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEP.3.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zef 3:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEP.3.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 8:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ririmba unezerwe, yewe mukobga w’i Siyoni: rāba ndaje ngo ngerēre hagati muri wewe, ni k’Uhoraho agize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.2.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 2:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kur’ uwo musi amahanga menshi azokwifatanya n’ Uhoraho, bacike abantu banje; nanje nzogerēra hagati muri wewe, nawe uzomenya yuk’ Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo yakuntumyeko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 32:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Uhoraho azohindura i Buyuda habe ishamvu yiwe yo mu gihugu cera, kand’ azokwongera kwirobanurira Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HAB.2.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hab 2:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni muhwekerere imbere y’ Uhoraho, yemwe abafise umubiri mwese, kukw avyukurutse i we, ahēra hiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
